        "slc_d1e2283b217a625986858acb3a44d048fda931d2c033c858a2de61b4f4fa8656"
      ],
      "text": "Supacode is a native macOS application (macOS 26.0+ required) that acts as a command center for running coding agents in parallel."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_efd1bb32ede8674e3d21bf6832a8092f258a99af4fdaab2dd71da7d9c011ad88",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7",
          "git_sha": "43ca1b7e2ce103d28c02bca16ae300dcd9acc537",
          "line_end": 7,
          "line_start": 5,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "supabitapp/supacode",
          "url": "https://github.com/supabitapp/supacode/blob/81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7/README.md#L5-L7"
        },
        {
          "commit": "81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7",
          "git_sha": "43ca1b7e2ce103d28c02bca16ae300dcd9acc537",
          "line_end": 21,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "supabitapp/supacode",
          "url": "https://github.com/supabitapp/supacode/blob/81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7/README.md#L17-L21"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b3d07674ebc9c186dec7ba6cdceb37aeb85a75a9abca4338def48be39ce5eb4f",
        "slc_f56dca3cefa2695d60c536f10d63c9f7dfa840af2f8a7b50bc1ab05bbb65d840"
      ],
      "text": "Each task gets its own git worktree and real terminal so agents run in parallel without colliding; worktrees can be created from the sidebar, hotkey, command palette, CLI, or deeplink."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6e34f8bfa3b5989771a5febc10c07025fa8b4c72ae26bc09f9adc23b33bd62fc",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7",
          "git_sha": "43ca1b7e2ce103d28c02bca16ae300dcd9acc537",
          "line_end": 27,
          "line_start": 25,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "supabitapp/supacode",
          "url": "https://github.com/supabitapp/supacode/blob/81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7/README.md#L25-L27"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a596bbc279933987d72e144c5ae32d059936264c59dc43bc093bc03407e7fa60"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions run inside zmx, a session daemon, rather than as app children, so quitting and relaunching reattaches sessions with scrollback; this is on by default with an optional teardown quit."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_efcc6ae171408e9bb261b1a8236a8fc211f10be1aa829a8eff985b5f2f538449",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7",
          "git_sha": "43ca1b7e2ce103d28c02bca16ae300dcd9acc537",
          "line_end": 35,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "supabitapp/supacode",
          "url": "https://github.com/supabitapp/supacode/blob/81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7/README.md#L31-L35"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_c223811e5a634567dc2180a3f7541b0a86751bb1d4474286c836b929deebcabe"
      ],
      "text": "Remote SSH repositories are supported in beta: git probes and terminals share one multiplexed SSH connection, and with zmx on the host, remote sessions survive dropped connections and sleep."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1ca17220c02cf118c478f77e87464e44a03671b15f270792a0d3810537f52b85",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7",
          "git_sha": "43ca1b7e2ce103d28c02bca16ae300dcd9acc537",
          "line_end": 54,
          "line_start": 51,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "supabitapp/supacode",
          "url": "https://github.com/supabitapp/supacode/blob/81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7/README.md#L51-L54"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1c32d638bc850b053ec4433c0696121fc397d08857021e4354f72df2bc4a185a"
      ],
      "text": "A `supacode` CLI manages worktrees, tabs, splits, and repos; sessions export repo, worktree, tab, and surface IDs, and `supacode://` deeplinks mirror CLI actions."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d5a7b591406a7b56b73604c4bc37ab25a0676b514e26b453f693b7a76dc094aa",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7",
          "git_sha": "43ca1b7e2ce103d28c02bca16ae300dcd9acc537",
          "line_end": 47,
          "line_start": 45,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "supabitapp/supacode",
          "url": "https://github.com/supabitapp/supacode/blob/81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7/README.md#L45-L47"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_99e27c4aa6d4cc85932376e1f6d8131b4450d1e3465466c31f9adfa5557256ff"
      ],
      "text": "The app detects the coding agent per pane (busy, awaiting input, idle) via installed hooks, supporting Claude, Codex, and Copilot locally and over SSH, and drives notifications."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3e6ade29cc1fa6f941efcaaa365948cd4e3ecf6f380355301efb2c4541a9d5a4",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7",
          "git_sha": "43ca1b7e2ce103d28c02bca16ae300dcd9acc537",
          "line_end": 41,
          "line_start": 39,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "supabitapp/supacode",
          "url": "https://github.com/supabitapp/supacode/blob/81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7/README.md#L39-L41"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_129080a4b6e9ed8870c7b20efc9fa9786ae98d43d73c07834cc5f088b9b07f8b"
      ],
      "text": "Plain folders are first-class alongside git repos, getting a persistent terminal with tabs, scripts, and pinning but without git-only tools; remote URLs can be cloned into a folder."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fbd2c36d4c3662bb20f026d01467ae112b5cb0ef9fae0dfe63eb0e6a792f7104",
