          "url": "https://github.com/supabitapp/supacode/blob/81cba5538f1e9618308dfea89dbd424b908ed0d7/README.md#L58-L69"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_089567cdaede062e95219583f9a7875be8e86b734461eb9b39390f013f1dd3e9"
      ],
      "text": "With GitHub integration enabled, each worktree's PR state, checks, and merge readiness display in the sidebar and refresh live with a configurable merge strategy."
    },
