      "text": "Repository development practice: contributors use mise for a pinned toolchain, git submodules, and make targets (doctor, build-ghostty-xcframework, build-app, run-app); on macOS 26.4+ Xcode 26.3 is needed because the pinned Zig 0.15.2 linker cannot link that SDK."
    },
